 ('Physical significance', "The classical-tagger map separates datasets more than architectures: networks trained on JetClass and Top Landscape act like groomed-mass + substructure taggers, those trained on hls4ml like plain-mass taggers, in line with claim D21. Which groomed observable is used, and whether the similarity exceeds random networks by an exact test, needs the rerun (H58).", None),
