 ('Method', "Fresh seeds 6761–6763, same sizes. Prong sharing $s=1-\\sum_k(P_k/P)^2$ measured for both edits. New references MLP($s,p_T$), MLP($m,s,p_T$), MLP($m,D_2,p_T$), MLP($m,\\tau_{21},p_T$). A displacement-matched rotation crot_dm (0.027 rad, as $E_w$; H67's crot moved 0.048 rad). Paired tests $|\\Delta s(E_w)|-|\\Delta s(\\mathrm{crot\\_dm})|$, Holm over 31 cells.", None),
